{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_138_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_138","textTraditional":"一、六年，春王正月，公至自會。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_138_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_138","textTraditional":"二、二月辛巳，立武宮。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_138_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_138","textTraditional":"武宮者何？武公之宮也。立者何？立者不宜立也。立武宮，非禮也。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_138_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_138","textTraditional":"三、取鄟。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_138_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_138","textTraditional":"鄟者何？邾婁之邑也。曷為不繫于邾婁？諱亟也。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_138_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_138","textTraditional":"四、衞孫良夫率師侵宋。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_138_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_138","textTraditional":"五、夏六月，邾婁子來朝。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_138_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_138","textTraditional":"六、公孫嬰齊如晉。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_cdt_138_9","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_138","textTraditional":"七、壬申，鄭伯費卒。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_cdt_138_10","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_138","textTraditional":"八、秋，仲孫蔑、叔孫僑如率師侵宋。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_cdt_138_11","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_138","textTraditional":"九、楚公子嬰齊率師伐鄭。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_cdt_138_12","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_138","textTraditional":"十、冬，季孫行父如晉。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_cdt_138_13","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_138","textTraditional":"十一、晉欒書率師侵鄭。","sentenceOrder":13}],"overrides":{}}